  "text": "🐾 Shih Tzu Feature: Meet Charlie! 🐾\n\nMeet Charlie, our sweet 6-year-old Shih Tzu who truly believes there is no such thing as too much love or attention. ❤️\n\nCharlie is happiest when he has his favorite toys, a human to snuggle with, and plenty of attention to soak up. He is the sweetest guy around and has never met a cuddle he didn’t like.\n\nAnd Charlie isn’t an only child! He has two cat brothers who he absolutely adores, Freddie and Ludwig! Whether they’re playing together or getting into a little mischief, Charlie loves having his feline brothers around. 🐶🐱🐱\n\nAt the end of the day, Charlie is just a happy little guy who loves his people, his toys, his snuggles, and his family. We’re pretty sure he has perfected the art of being the sweetest Shih Tzu around. 💕\n\nEveryone say hi to Charlie! 🐾\n\n#shihtzu #shihtzusofinstagram #beantowntzucrew #bostonshihtzumeetup #shihtzumeetup",
